[*] Now buildings can be placed on unlocked plots;
[*] When removing buildings and plots, some gold coins will be returned, which is convenient for adjusting the farm layout in the early stage of the game;
[*] When choosing card rewards, it can now be temporarily closed and returned to the game interface, which is convenient for viewing and removing inappropriate plots;
